<title>THAILAND: Jasmine Q3 net profit sharply down.</title>
<headline>Jasmine Q3 net profit sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		    0.9     vs	2.11</p>
<p>    Net			   301.75    vs    703.73</p>
<p>					   Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		    2.53    vs	4.42</p>
<p>    Net			   703.73    vs  1,146.68</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Jasmine International Plc, a telecommunications company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
